    "body": "## Summary\n- hide the entire Events block at fresh Stage 7.15 Start and reveal it only at the first canonical event point\n- preserve the exact canonical Rayhan invite copy `нефиг дерзить тут сопля`\n- keep scripted Rayhan counter identity/text stable after a wrong choice, reveal the argument color, and wait for a player chat reply before resolving the event\n- preserve source/deployed mirrors and add focused regressions\n\n## Validation\n- visible fresh runtime acceptance from Start through the Rayhan wrong-counter waiting state and post-reply event reveal\n- `tools/test_stage7_15_rayhan_answer_validation.py`\n- `tools/test_stage7_15_82_visible_first_event_entry.py`\n- `tools/test_stage7_15_tone_first_battle.py`\n- `tools/test_stage7_15_safari_corridor.py`\n- mirror parity, `node --check`, `git diff --check`\n\nSafari acceptance is not claimed. M83 was not started.",
